            0.121
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You would observe that it is acidic in nature (Fig. 4.7d)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.123,
            0.532,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "On burning sulfur in air (oxygen), sulfur dioxide gas is formed. On dissolving sulfur dioxide gas in water, sulfurous acid is formed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.199,
            0.532,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Does sulfur behave in water the same way metals do?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.537,
            0.072,
